Package: PlantVelocity
Title: Plant RNA Velocity Analysis with Long-Read Intron Retention Priors
Version: 0.5.1
Description: Estimates and visualizes RNA velocity in plant single-cell
    data using a two-state model of unspliced and spliced RNA, with
    intron-retention-associated signals excluded from velocity inference
    and analyzed separately through descriptive statistics and visualization.
